These grants apply only to rights Ranzevor is authorized to license. Third-party standards, specifications, documentation, code, trademarks, quotations, and other third-party material remain subject to their own terms. A URL, source record, hash, bounded paraphrase, or attribution does not relicense the underlying third-party work. See `NOTICE.md`, `LICENSE-NOTICE.md`, `governance/LICENSING.md`, and `sources/README.md`.

